# Trivy suppressions.
#
# The Security workflow runs Trivy with `scanners: secret,misconfig` only —
# dependency advisories are handled by .github/scripts/audit-check.mjs, which
# requires a written justification and an expiry per entry. Keep it that way:
# a CVE suppressed here would be invisible to that review process.
#
# Format: one finding ID per line, each with a comment explaining why.
# Currently empty.
